                        </signed>
                    </closer>
                </div>
            </div> <div type="notes">
                <note xml:id="note1" target="#seg1" type="commentary">In the <rs type="letter" key="L_68769">postcard of 6 June 1921</rs> (<name type="work" key="ID_MISSING">LIII</name> 44) Joyce asked whether Sykes had returned a typescript. Most likely this was for ‘Circe’ or ‘Eumaeus’.</note>
